				(justify left)
			)
		)
		(property "Note" "CAN FD controller. Requires a 40, 20 or 4 MHz reference; this board uses 40 MHz from Y1, so the overlay must say oscillator=40000000. Datasheet Fosc1,40M is 40 MHz +/-0.5% (+/-5000 ppm); the ABLS2 delivers ~+/-105 ppm worst case, ~48x inside it. RXCAN Vil = 0.3 x VDD = 0.99V, which is the margin D6's activity LED on the RXD net sits against."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
