			)
		)
		(property "Note" "ORDER BY FULL PART NUMBER ONLY. The 'F' selects fundamental mode: at 40 MHz the ABLS2 STANDARD product is 3rd overtone, which will not oscillate in the MCP2518FD's Pierce circuit (it would run at ~13.3 MHz while the driver is told 40 MHz). The 'D' selects -40/+85C; ABLS2 standard is 0/+70C. CL = 18pF (standard, no CL field in the part number) -> C5/C6 = 27pF. ESR 40 ohm max, drive 1000uW max. NOTE the footprint is named XTAL_ABLS2-12.000MHZ-D4Y-T - that is a misnomer from the imported library."
			(at 81.28 140.97 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
